{"body":"## Disposition\nThe original universal completed finite-group Green-ring symmetry question remains **unsolved after 5/5 substantive turns**. The full independent audit passes the scoped results. No actual-group nonsymmetry counterexample or universal theorem is claimed.\n\n## Scoped results\n- Algebraic-field and countable tensor-closure reductions\n- Symmetry of weighted endotrivial spans and the p-group full/stable splitting\n- An explicit Q8 signed spectral-restriction obstruction, with real spectrum\n- Finite nonsymmetric abstract representation rings satisfying all five axioms, separately proved nonrealizable as based finite-group Green rings\n- Symmetry of the actual induced-endotrivial closed span for elementary abelian groups, with module-coordinate injectivity and two-sided bounds for the completed Möbius decomposition; an explicit F8 module shows that this family can be proper\n\nBenson's endotrivial growth inputs, Carlson/Dade prerequisites, Langer's quaternion resolution and classical induction identities are credited. The controlling retrieved Benson edition is arXiv:2008.13155v2; the full 2024 publisher PDF was not retrieved. No novelty certification is asserted.\n\n## Reproducibility and scope\nAll 42 frozen author files and six whitelisted review files are preserved unchanged, with three additive publication artifacts. All 184,604 author assertions and 14,871 independent controls pass, including a relocated portable replay. See `unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30004106/STATUS.md`, `RESULT.md` and `review/REVIEW.md`; run `python verify_publication.py` in that folder.\n\nThe integration has fresh main as first parent and final author WIP `59ecabf2953d6c0d39e51a341a554152927b7b6c` as second parent. Its final diff changes only this target's 51 artifacts and its own QUEUE status/turn cells. Raw sources and working notes are excluded. Draft only; no merge or release.","headRefOid":"1747a651d5865cfbbe3c4eef7ab3c8142fc117f4","isDraft":true,"mergeStateStatus":"UNKNOWN","mergeable":"UNKNOWN","state":"OPEN"}
